<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Demo Dinonaktifin</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 min-h-screen">
  <%- include('../partials/demo-nav', { title: 'Demo Dinonaktifin' }) %>

  <main class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
      <div class="text-4xl mb-3">🔒</div>
      <h2 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Halaman <code><%= path %></code> lagi dinonaktifin</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4">
        Route ini sengaja nunjukin behavior rentan (buat belajar), jadi
        DIMATIIN SECARA DEFAULT biar aman kalo project ini kepasang di
        production.
      </p>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3 text-left text-sm text-gray-600">
        Buat aktifin (cuma di laptop lokal buat belajar):
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Buka file <code>.env</code></li>
          <li>Set <code>ENABLE_VULN_DEMO=true</code></li>
          <li>Restart server (<code>npm run dev</code>)</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
